  "synthesis": {
    "recommendation": "DROP_FROM_CONTINUOUS_MODELS_KEEP_AS_EVENT_OVERLAY",
    "reasoning": "While point-in-time news features modestly lifted 1D Rank IC from -0.0263 to -0.0027 (+0.0236 delta), they degraded 5D Rank IC from +0.0904 to +0.0619 (-0.0286 delta). Standalone correlations across all news features exhibit p-values > 0.14 with low 1-day coverage (7.5%). Sparse news features introduce noise into continuous regression trees. Recommendation: Drop continuous news features from the primary return forecasting model; retain the event store as an event-driven filter / risk overlay for earnings and regulatory dates."
  }
